\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌确认新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练阶段，有望远早于年底发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind负责人科拉伊·卡武克奥卢在AI Agenda Live峰会上确认，新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入“后训练初期”阶段，该阶段旨在进一步提升模型的行为可靠性。谷歌决定跳过Gemini 3.5 Pro的发布计划，将资源集中于Gemini 4的研发，并力争在“远早于年底”的时间点推出。目前，Gemini 4正处于防护机制开发与安全测试阶段，谷歌工程师已在内部将其应用于Antigravity AI编程工具中。卡武克奥卢表示，团队对Gemini 4的早期测试结果感到振奋，未来将持续快速迭代。此次调整标志着谷歌在Gemini 3.1系列之后，正式将重心转向下一代旗舰架构，旨在通过构建值得信任的智能体，保持在AI技术领域的前沿竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a4bff8a49fa33f8572fdc481f881ca00.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 24, 202645智元把具身智能的产能刻度又往前推了一大格。9月24日，第20000台通用具身智能机器人远征A3Ultra在横琴长隆飞船乐园正式走下产线，并当场交到长隆集团手里。从今年3月跨过万台门槛到如今的两万台，这家公司只用了约6个月——产能爬坡的曲线，已经明显进入了加速段。同一天，由智元与长隆联手打造的全球首个大规模具身智能主题乐园在横琴长隆飞船乐园启幕，超过300台智元全系机器人开始在园区里常态化上岗，扎进游客互动、导览、演艺和科普研学等场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT移动端推出语音智能体功能支持文档撰写与任务执行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd51c491a1a376446f6771e9bdc289bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式在ChatGPT移动端上线基于语音的智能体功能，旨在将语音交互从简单的问答升级为端到端的任务执行。Pro和Plus订阅用户现可通过语音指令直接创建文档、撰写电子邮件、总结Slack消息，并支持创建网站、制作PPT及调用云端浏览器等进阶操作。Free和Go订阅用户则可利用插件与已连接应用进行交互。此次更新强化了多模态协作体验，Plus用户可在文本与语音间无缝切换，并支持跨设备工作流，即在手机端处理的任务可同步至电脑端继续完成。该功能标志着ChatGPT在移动端生产力场景的进一步落地，通过语音交互直接驱动复杂任务处理，显著提升了移动办公的自动化效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta Connect发布会：Muse接入AI眼镜并推出多款智能硬件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0596dd329feb9582c2f0b2e7dba946d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在9月23日的Meta Connect大会上，Meta宣布旗下个人智能体Muse全面接入AI眼镜，用户可通过“Hey Muse”语音指令实现健身指导、购物辅助及环境理解。Muse还将拥有专属邮箱，并推出Mac端App以实现计算机任务操作。硬件方面，Meta发布了无摄像头版Ray-Ban Meta Audio Glasses（349美元，续航12小时）及Ray-Ban Meta Gen 3（449美元）。此外，Meta预告了将于2027年春季上市、重约100克的轻量级VR眼镜（1299美元起），以及类似电子宠物的独立终端Muse Charm。Meta计划到2026年底提供超100种AI眼镜款式，并为听力受损人群推出听力增强功能。Muse自9月8日发布以来已登顶美区应用商店榜首，未来Meta将通过交易收取费用实现商</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek年化收入突破10亿美元，拟募资500亿元冲刺上交所上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/58f6242907fbe1a7a1c35a2eb3f7b308.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek年化收入已突破10亿美元，较数月前实现翻倍增长，主要得益于模型定价上调及开发者与企业端采用率的持续攀升。首席执行官梁文峰在投资者会议上披露了该财务数据。目前，DeepSeek正处于第二轮融资的关键期，计划在10月底前完成募资500亿元人民币，投后估值预计达5000亿元人民币，并紧锣密鼓筹备上海证券交易所上市。在生成式AI商业化变现普遍面临挑战的背景下，DeepSeek此次融资与上市计划创下国内大模型初创企业一级市场资本规模新纪录，不仅印证了其大模型技术的商业落地能力，也为本土AI企业冲刺公开资本市场提供了重要风向标。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
